(b) the manufacturer of goods or the provider of output service shall, determine and pay, provisionally, for every month,-
(i) the amount equivalent to CENVAT credit attributable to inputs used in or in relation to manufacture of exempted
goods, denoted as A;
(ii) the amount of CENVAT credit attributable to inputs used for provision of exempted services (provisional) = (B/C)
multiplied by D, where B denotes the total value of exempted services provided during the preceding financial year, C
denotes the total value of dutiable goods manufactured and removed plus the total value of taxable services provided
plus the total value of exempted services provided, during the preceding financial year and D denotes total CENVAT
credit taken on inputs during the month minus A;
